As a Senior Target Operating Model (TOM) Consultant, you will lead the design and implementation of a sustainable operating model that enables platform adoption at scale through Platform-as-a-Product and self-service principles.
* Lead the definition of the target operating model, ensuring alignment with platform strategy, organizational objectives and governance requirements;
* Design operating frameworks covering roles, responsibilities, decision rights, interaction models and service ownership across business and technology teams;
* Define and document platform services, governance mechanisms, support models and operational processes to enable sustainable platform operations;
* Collaborate with platform, security, operations and application teams to drive adoption and validate the TOM through onboarding and migration scenarios;
* Establish KPI frameworks, service objectives and governance structures to monitor performance and continuous improvement;
* Deliver recommendations and adoption strategies that enable scalability across business units, functions and geographies.

* Proven experience designing and implementing Target Operating Models within large-scale transformation or platform modernization programs;
* 1 year experience on AWS Cloud technology is mandatory;
* Strong understanding of Platform-as-a-Product, self-service operating models, service management and organizational design principles;
* Experience defining governance frameworks, RACI matrices, decision rights and operating processes across multiple stakeholder groups;
* Ability to bridge business and technology teams, translating strategic objectives into practical operating models and processes;
* Excellent stakeholder management, facilitation and communication skills, with experience engaging senior leadership.
* Fluent in English and French; experience in financial services.

* Craft your own career path through continuous learning and personal growth;
* Experience the benefits of hybrid working, offering flexibility and ensuring work-life balance;
* Harness the strength of diverse teams, fostering innovation and inclusive collaboration;
* We offer additional benefits such as 5 weeks of vacation, Employee referral bonus, Company shares program and Annual contribution to a fitness subscription.
